    "verified": true,
    "priority": 1,
    "title": "形状",
    "description": "一边打枪战一边聊薛定谔。Root 认为这算安慰。",
    "quote": [
      {
        "who": "Root",
        "line": "So I was thinking about your thing."
      },
      {
        "who": "Shaw",
        "line": "My thing?"
      },
      {
        "who": "Root",
        "line": "Your whole \"I'm crazy and the world's just a simulation\" thing? It's a little like when Harry had me locked up and I was questioning everything."
      },
      {
        "who": "Shaw",
        "line": "Can we talk about this after the whole lethal shootout thing?"
      },
      {
        "who": "Root",
        "line": "No time like the present, Sameen. Besides, if this is just another simulation, who cares if we die?"
      },
      {
        "who": "Root",
        "line": "Anyway, Schrodinger said at its base level, the universe isn't made up of physical matter, but just shapes. I thought that might make you feel better."
      },
      {
        "who": "Shaw",
        "line": "Seriously?"
      },
      {
        "who": "Root",
        "line": "A shape, you know? Nothing firm. What it means is the real world is essentially a simulation anyway."
      },
      {
        "who": "Shaw",
        "line": "You are the last person I should have confided in about this."
      },
      {
        "who": "Root",
        "line": "I liked that idea. That even if we're not real, we represent a dynamic. A tiny finger tracing a line in the infinite. A shape. And then we're gone."
      },
      {
        "who": "Shaw",
        "line": "That's supposed to make me feel better? I'm a shape?"
      },
      {
        "who": "Root",
        "line": "Yeah. And, darlin', you got a great shape."
      },
      {
        "who": "Shaw",
        "line": "I swear to God, you flirt at the most awkward times."
      },
      {
        "who": "Root",
        "line": "I know."
      },
      {
        "who": "Root",
        "line": "Listen, all I'm saying is that if we're just information, just noise in the system... we might as well be a symphony."
      }
    ],
